  "history": [
    {
      "date": "2026-04-27",
      "description": "Added the level 6 Druid. Druid6 Reduced upgrade time at levels 2 and 3: Level 2: 9d -> 8d Time Level 3: 9d 12h -> 9d Time"
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-14",
      "description": "Increased healing per second at levels 5 and 6: Level 5: 100 -> 105 Hitpoints Level 6: 105 -> 115 Hitpoints"
    }
  ],
  "facts": [
    "The Druid is the eleventh Dark Elixir Troop in the game, who is unlocked when the Dark Barracks is upgraded to level 11, which requires Town Hall 14.",
    "For the first 30 seconds after the Druid is deployed, he heals allied troops with his staff. His healing projectiles bounce between up to 4 targets, and can target both ground and air."
  ],
